# Pinch-to-zoom while a film is recorded (user report 2026-11-12: "pinch to zoom ... durante la registrazione ... stuttering e lag").
# Run: phone.py scenario <this file> runs/vp1 --wait-s 6
# Phases (each ends with a log slice): A rest in Video, not recording | B recording, zoom at rest (1x) | C recording, slow pinches
# ABOVE 1x only (device zoom 2.0 .. ~4: no change of sensor, warm window 2.0..2.6 only at the start) | D recording, zoom at rest
# zoomed (~2x: the zoomed picture path, nothing moving) | E recording, pinches that CROSS 1x <-> 0.6x (change of sensor) | F stopped.
launch camera
sleep 3
mode video
sleep {wait}
logs
shot A-rest --scale 4
shutter
sleep {wait}
logs
shot B-rec-rest --scale 4
pinch 540 1000 300 520 --ms 1500
sleep 0.4
pinch 540 1000 520 300 --ms 1500
sleep 0.4
pinch 540 1000 300 600 --ms 1500
sleep 0.4
pinch 540 1000 600 300 --ms 1500
sleep 0.4
pinch 540 1000 300 700 --ms 2000
sleep 0.4
pinch 540 1000 700 400 --ms 2000
sleep 0.4
pinch 540 1000 400 700 --ms 2000
logs
shot C-rec-pinched --scale 4
sleep {wait}
logs
shot D-rec-zoomed-rest --scale 4
pinch 540 1000 800 200 --ms 2000
sleep 0.4
pinch 540 1000 200 300 --ms 1500
sleep 0.4
pinch 540 1000 300 200 --ms 1500
sleep 0.4
pinch 540 1000 200 400 --ms 1500
sleep 0.4
pinch 540 1000 400 200 --ms 1500
logs
shot E-rec-crossing --scale 4
shutter
sleep 4
logs
shot F-stopped --scale 4
